#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:3
msgid "Welcome to CodeIgniter4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter is a PHP full-stack web framework that is light, fast, "
"flexible and secure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"It is an Application Development Framework - a toolkit - for people who "
"build web sites using PHP. Its goal is to enable you to develop projects "
"much faster than you could if you were writing code from scratch, by "
"providing a rich set of libraries for commonly needed tasks, as well as a"
" simple interface and logical structure to access these libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter lets you creatively focus on your project by minimizing the "
"amount of code needed for a given task."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"Where possible, CodeIgniter has been kept as flexible as possible, "
"allowing you to work in the way you want, not being forced into working "
"any certain way. The framework can have core parts easily extended or "
"completely replaced to make the system work the way you need it to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"In short, CodeIgniter is the malleable framework that tries to provide "
"the tools you need while staying out of the way."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:28
msgid "Is CodeIgniter Right for You?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:30
msgid "CodeIgniter is right for you if:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:32
msgid "You want a framework with a small footprint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:33
msgid "You need exceptional performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"You want a framework that incorporates a number of features and "
"techniques to enable you to do good security practices easily."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"You want a non-magical framework that you can easily find and read the "
"source code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:38
msgid "You want a framework that requires nearly zero configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:39
msgid ""
"You want a framework that does not require you to adhere to restrictive "
"coding rules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:41
msgid "You want a framework that makes it easy to create test code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"You do not want to be forced to learn a templating language (although a "
"template parser is optionally available if you desire one)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:44
msgid "You eschew complexity, favoring simple solutions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/intro/index.rst:45
msgid "You need clear, thorough documentation."
msgstr ""

